DENG-582: the C field of NavBakeProgress.auto is a C keyword.
Pinned DIDE protocol 1.25-6b91fb578b4a.

The generator names the struct member after the wire key `auto`, which C11 reserves,
so the header and source do not compile. Rename the member to `auto_`; the wire key
stays "auto". No protocol bytes or other API change. Drop once the generator escapes
C keywords (reported upstream).

